# Git under KaiavN

For this Eden repository, **all git and GitHub work must go through `KaiavN`**.

## Required

- Remote must be `https://github.com/KaiavN/Eden.git` (or SSH equivalent under `KaiavN/Eden`)
- PRs, issues, releases, and `gh` commands target the **`KaiavN/Eden`** repo
- New branches, pushes, and remotes stay under the **KaiavN** org/account — never a personal fork or alternate owner unless the user explicitly overrides

## Examples

```bash
# ✅ GOOD
git remote -v   # origin → github.com/KaiavN/Eden.git
gh pr create    # against KaiavN/Eden
git push -u origin HEAD

# ❌ BAD
git remote set-url origin https://github.com/<other-user>/Eden.git
gh pr create --repo <other-user>/Eden
```

If the remote is not under `KaiavN`, stop and fix it (or ask) before pushing or opening a PR.
